  {
   "years": "1990-2021",
   "note": "The NGA archive relays NAVAREA III and the Greek NAVTEX stations for this region. The totals in these years are dominated by those relays."
  },
  {
   "years": "2022-",
   "note": "The relay largely stops: 946 of the region's 1,034 warnings in 2020 were NAVAREA III relays, against 66 in 2022, and by 2023 most of what remains is issued by Romania and the rescue coordination centres. The fall in the totals after 2021 is a change in what the archive carries, not a measured fall in activity, and a reader must not read it as one. The per-year `by_authority` breakdown is here so that change is visible."
  }
